OL,5,G0005 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,6,     FThe heli-medics help a man with a
OL,7,     Fsingle back wound who's not sure
OL,8,     Fif he's been shot or stabbed. And
OL,9,     Fa cyclist needs immediate
OL,10,     Flife-saving treatment on the
OL,11,     Froadside.
OL,12,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FPaul, who's 62, has transverse
OL,14,     Fmyelitis and may have had a
OL,15,     Fstroke. Josh, who's 28, has a
OL,16,     Fbadly broken leg. And Eric's come
OL,17,     Fto A&E with his granddaughter
OL,18,     Fafter becoming dizzy.
